1
00:00:00,117 --> 00:00:01,717
(Penny:)and we promise
we'll leave you alone.

2
00:00:01,719 --> 00:00:03,519
(Amy:)Fine. Um...

3
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:05,350
(Amy:)he's British.

4
00:00:05,356 --> 00:00:07,026
(both squeal)

5
00:00:07,957 --> 00:00:10,927
(chuckling):
All right, that is a juicy one.

6
00:00:10,928 --> 00:00:13,428
(Penny:)All right, where is
Tall British Dave taking you?

7
00:00:13,430 --> 00:00:16,130
(Bernadette:)Tea and basketball?

8
00:00:16,133 --> 00:00:18,363
(Amy:)To that new Italian place
on Walnut.

9
00:00:18,369 --> 00:00:19,499
(Bernadette:)Oh, nice.

10
00:00:19,503 --> 00:00:21,333
(Amy:)I'm gonna go look for other shoes.
Good luck.

11
00:00:21,338 --> 00:00:23,768
(Penny:)I threw out all my tall ones
when I married Leonard.

12
00:00:25,942 --> 00:00:27,312
(Bernadette:)Hey, you want

13
00:00:27,311 --> 00:00:29,581
(Bernadette:)to swing by that place tonight
and get a look at this guy?

14
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:31,850
(Penny:)We don't even know what time
they're gonna be there.

15
00:00:31,849 --> 00:00:33,179
(Bernadette:)I'll just call the restaurant,

16
00:00:33,183 --> 00:00:34,953
(Bernadette:)pretend I'm Amy
and check the reservation.

17
00:00:34,952 --> 00:00:37,422
(Penny:)Damn, you're sneaky.

18
00:00:37,421 --> 00:00:39,691
(Bernadette:)Yeah, but I'm little,
so it's adorable.

19
00:00:42,692 --> 00:00:45,562
(Howard:)I think the quickest way
to find you a new girlfriend

20
00:00:45,562 --> 00:00:49,032
(Howard:)is just to get you on every
dating Web site out there.

21
00:00:49,032 --> 00:00:50,362
(Sheldon:)Are you sure?

22
00:00:50,367 --> 00:00:52,767
(Sheldon:)I've heard that on those
sites, often when you think

23
00:00:52,770 --> 00:00:55,300
(Sheldon:)you're corresponding with someone,
it's actually a computer program

24
00:00:55,305 --> 00:00:57,335
(Sheldon:)pretending to be
a real person.

25
00:00:57,341 --> 00:01:00,881
(Raj:)And you're afraid
it'll do a better job than you?

